### About the Venue:

- A map of the area around the Olympia Centre

- Recommended directions:

- *From Heathrow Airport:*

Take the express train to Paddington Station;
one leaves every 15 minutes between 05h30 and 11h30
and the trip takes about 15 minutes. Round-trip
fare is £22, one-way is £12. The
train will arrive at Paddington on either track
6 or track 7. The taxi queue is just outside
the station at track 1; take a taxi to your hotel
near the Olympia Centre.

- *From Gatwick Airport:*

Take the dedicated train from South Terminal to London Victoria
Station. (There are also Thameslink trains that go to other
stations.) The dedicated train leaves every 15 minutes during
the day, less often in the evening. The trip takes about 30
minutes, and costs £10.20 one-way if the ticket is bought
on the train. The taxi queue is just outside Victoria Station
on the middle median.

### Air Travel from the USA to London

**American Airlines** is providing special rates for
ApacheCon Europe 2000attendees. Please call the American Airlines Group and Meetings Desk at
+1.800.433.1790, or call your local American Airlines office. Please refer
to **AN# 45HOAT**. You can also call Rosenbluth Travel
at +1.800.704.6490 and mention you are attending
ApacheCon Europe 2000.

### Air Travel from Europe to London

Please call Rosenbluth Travel at +1.800.704.6490 and mention you are attending
ApacheCon Europe 2000

### Rental Car Information

Avis Car Rental discounts are available from one week prior to the
conference through one week following. Please call +1.800.331.2212
(or your local Avis office) and refer to code **D130767**. You
can also reserve your Avis car when calling either the American Airlines
Group and Meeting desk (+1.800.221.2255) or Rosenbluth Travel
(+1.800.704.6490). Please mention that you are attending
ApacheCon Europe 2000.

### Hotel Information

The hotel rates are in British pounds sterling, and include 17.5% VAT
but do **not** include breakfast.

**Hilton London Olympia**

380 Kensington High Street

London W14 8NL

